1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,187
The Pentagon is the first shape where the vertices don't all land on notes at the same time.

2
00:00:05,187 --> 00:00:10,625
Before rotating this shape and listening to the results take a guess as to what you think it will play.

3
00:00:10,625 --> 00:00:12,662
Pause the video if you want.

4
00:00:12,662 --> 00:00:16,350
When I first ran this I was a bit surprised by the result.

5
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:20,400
It's playing a chromatic scale all 12 notes in ascending order.

6
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:24,000
Add this to your list of useless but interesting facts.

